                      width: active ? 2 : 1,
                    ),
                  ),
                ),
                child: Column(
                  mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,
                  children: [
                    Icon(
                      active ? t.activeIcon : t.icon,
                      size: 15,
                      color: active ? AppTheme.cyan : AppTheme.textLo,
                    ),
                    const SizedBox(height: 2),
                    Text(
                      t.label,
                      style: GoogleFonts.jetBrainsMono(
                        fontSize: 8,
